{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you remember your worst nightmare? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Next of Kin: Fidelity, you follow Bjorn, a man haunted by a past that refuses to let go. A single event from his childhood still clings to him like a shadow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, he wakes up drenched in sweat, trapped in the same nightmare over and over again. But what is it that's haunting him \u2013 and how, or who, can set him free? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a player, you\u2019re encouraged to explore every corner of the world. The more you interact with your surroundings, the more pieces of the story you'll uncover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next of Kin: Fidelity is a deeply emotional journey lasting 2\u20134 hours, featuring pixel art, atmospheric music, and a strong focus on storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bittersweet story with a mix of comedy and mature subjects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features several endings depending on your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues, solve puzzles, and uncover the truth about Bjorn's past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack that enhances the story beats   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be a short but sweet experience </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Don't Start A Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548270/13e9c85eeef3dbe046604cad37d06dbab5801423.jpg"},{"name":"Started The Fire!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548270/c84ed2bbbe7e63c67dda030c7f4e3e9e6aa2c372.jpg"},{"name":"Weirdo!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3548270/662ece164e62d505c61308ac9ebd0065650285ec.jpg"},{"name":"Backhand!","path